                                    <div class="aboutOverviewPro text-justify">
                                        <p>
                                            <p>Lodha Raj Infinia is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Malad West locality of Mumbai. Spanning 5.46 Acres, the project features 498 Units in <u>Details Available Upon Request</u>, offering a mix of 2 BHK+2T, to 2 BHK+2T Apartments ranging from 740 sqft to 740 sqft. The address for the project is malad west, mumbai, maharashtra..</p>

<p><strong>Available Property Sizes</strong></p>

<p>The Apartments at Lodha Raj Infinia are available in a variety of sizes. The 2 BHK+2T units start at 740 sqft. The larger 2 BHK+2T Apartments go up to 740 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.</p>

<p><strong>Price Range</strong></p>

<p>The prices for the Apartments at Lodha Raj Infinia are designed to be accessible, with 2 BHK+2T units priced from 2.06 Cr and 2 BHK+2T Apartments from 2.06 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.</p>

<p><strong>Developer Information</strong></p>

<p>The project is being developed by Lodha Group, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P02200003083 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2023-12-14, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.</p>

<p><strong>Amenities and Features</strong></p>

<p>Lodha Raj Infinia is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Maintenance Staff, Multipurpose Hall, Garden. The security features include CCTV, Fire Alarm for enhanced safety.</p>

<p><strong>Construction and Specifications</strong></p>

<p>The project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.</p>

<p><strong>Key Information</strong></p>

<ul>
	<li>
	<p>Total Area: 5.46 Acres</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Units &amp; Towers: 498 Units, <u>Details Available Upon Request</u></p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Sizes: 740 sqft to 740 sqft</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Project Address: malad west, mumbai, maharashtra.</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Type: Residential Apartments</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Developer: Lodha Group</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>RERA Registration No.: P02200003083 Units</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Possession Start: 2023-12-14</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Security: CCTV, Fire Alarm</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Sports Facilities: Gym</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Maintenance Staff, Multipurpose Hall, Garden</p>
	</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Location Benefits</strong></p>

<p>Lodha Raj Infinia benefits from its location in Malad West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.</p>

<p><strong>Developer and Project Details</strong></p>

<p>Possession at Lodha Raj Infinia will begin in 2023-12-14, and the project is RERA registered under P02200003083 Units. Developed by Lodha Group, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.</p>
                                    </p>
